a\x09a number of domains such as <span class=\x22domain label\x22>example.com</span> and <span class=\x22domain label\x22>example.org</span>\x0a\x09are maintained for documentation purposes. These domains may be used as illustrative\x0a\x09examples in documents without prior coordination with us. They are \x0a\x09not available for registration or transfer.</p>\x0a\x0a\x09<h2>Test IDN top-level domains</h2>\x0a\x0a\x09        <p>These domains were temporarily delegated by IANA for the <a href=\x22http://www.icann.org/topics/idn/\x22>IDN Evaluation</a> being conducted by <a href=\x22http://www.icann.org/\x22>ICANN</a>.</p>\x0a\x0a\x09\x09<div class=\x22dtable-wrap\x22>\x0a\x09\x09<table id=\x22arpa-table\x22 class=\x22dtable\x22>\x0a\x09\x09\x09<thead>\x0a\x09\x09\x09<tr><th>Domain</th><th>Domain (A-label)</th><th>Language</th><th>Script</th></tr>\x0a\x09\x09\x09</thead>\x0a\x09\x09\x09<tbody>\x0a\x09\x09\x09<tr><td>&#1573;&#1582;&#1578;&#1576;&#1575;&#1585;</td><td><span class=\x22domain label\x22>xn--kgbechtv</span></td>\x0a\x09<td>Arabic</td><td>Arabic</td></tr>\x0a\x09<tr><td>&#1570;&#1586;&#1605;&#1575;&#1740;&#1588;&#1740;</td><td><span class=\x22domain label\x22>xn--hgbk6aj7f53bba</span></td>\x0a\x09<td>Persian</td><td>Arabic</td></tr>\x0a\x09<tr><td>&#27979;&#35797;</td><td><span class=\x22domain label\x22>xn--0zwm56d</span></td>\x0a\x09<td>Chinese</td><td>Han (Simplified variant)</td></tr>\x0a\x09<tr><td>&#28204;&#35430;</td><td><span class=\x22domain label\x22>xn--g6w251d</span></td>\x0a\x09<td>Chinese</td><td>Han (Traditional variant)</td></tr>\x0a\x09<tr><td>&#1080;&#1089;&#1087;&#1099;&#1090;&#1072;&#1085;&#1080;&#1077;</td><td><span class=\x22domain label\x22>xn--80akhbyknj4f</span></td>\x0a\x09<td>Russian</td><td>Cyrillic</td></tr>\x0a\x09<tr><td>&#2346;&#2352;&#2368;&#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2366;</td><td><span class=\x22domain label\x22>xn--11b5bs3a9aj6g</span></td>\x0a\x09<td>Hindi</td><td>Devanagari (Nagari)</td></tr>\x0a\x09<tr><td>&#948;&#959;&#954;&